# Jobs

Job tracking and audit logs.

Each job creates a JSON file:
`[TIMESTAMP]_[intent].json`

## Job Schema

```json
{
  "id": "uuid",
  "timestamp": "ISO8601",
  "intent": "brief|prep|task|draft|status|proposal",
  "inputs": {},
  "status": "pending|running|complete|failed",
  "artefacts": ["path/to/output.md"],
  "duration_ms": 1234,
  "context_used": ["path/to/source.md"]
}
```
